#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "984"
msgid "Chatty Businesswoman"
msgstr "Mujer de negocios habladora"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "988"
msgid "Reserved Businesswoman"
msgstr "Mujer de negocios reservada"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "992"
msgid "Talk_Yes"
msgstr "Talk_Yes"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "996"
msgid "Talk_Quest"
msgstr "Talk_Quest"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Chatty Businesswoman"
msgid "Doesn't it seem like there are more... thugs around town?"
msgstr "¿No parece que hay más... matones por la ciudad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Reserved Businesswoman"
msgid "Hm? I haven't noticed."
msgstr "¿Mm? No me he dado cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Chatty Businesswoman"
msgid "Well there totally are! People like that usually stick to\\r\nshadows, yet here they are roaming around in broad daylight!"
msgstr "¡Pues definitivamente los hay! Gente así suele quedarse\\r\nen las sombras, ¡pero están aquí paseandose por la ciudad\\r\na plena luz del día!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "120_Chatty Businesswoman"
msgid "I wonder if something's going on. Kamurocho is usually so\\r\nsafe and quiet, too!"
msgstr "Me pregunto si estará pasando algo.\\r\n¡Kamurocho sabe ser seguro y tranquilo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_Reserved Businesswoman"
msgid "Is it, though...?"
msgstr "¿Pero... lo es de verdad?"

